1
00:00:15,972 --> 00:00:20,816
Regarde ! Le marché de Noël !
Look! The Christmas market!

2
00:00:22,216 --> 00:00:25,116
Quelles belles décorations !
What beautiful decorations!

3
00:00:29,069 --> 00:00:34,393
Bonjour ! Venez voir, venez voir !
Hello! Come and see, come and see!

4
00:00:35,193 --> 00:00:38,837
C'est combien, cette étoile ?
How much is this star?

5
00:00:39,637 --> 00:00:42,369
Elle coûte cinq euros.
It costs five euros.

6
00:00:43,769 --> 00:00:46,525
C'est un peu cher !
That's a bit expensive!

7
00:00:47,925 --> 00:00:52,649
Mais elle est si jolie ! Je la prends.
But it's so pretty! I'll take it.

8
00:00:54,149 --> 00:01:00,001
Merci, mademoiselle ! Voulez-vous une boisson chaude ?
Thank you, miss! Would you like a hot drink?

9
00:01:00,101 --> 00:01:03,553
Pour moi, un chocolat chaud.
For me, a hot chocolate.

10
00:01:03,653 --> 00:01:08,017
Et pour moi, un vin chaud, s'il vous plaît.
And for me, a mulled wine, please.

11
00:01:08,817 --> 00:01:13,037
Voilà ! Joyeux Noël !
Here you go! Merry Christmas!

12
00:01:14,537 --> 00:01:17,293
Joyeux Noël !
Merry Christmas!

13
00:01:18,693 --> 00:01:21,761
Joyeux Noël à tous !
Merry Christmas, everyone!
